37
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:14.400
olwo situla mpola enviiri waggulu ng’onyiga wansi mpola n’ekikolo.

38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.920
Mu kusooka otunuuliddwa n’eriiso, olwo oleete ekitangaala kya arc okulaba nga kikuziddwa.

39
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Ddamu okukebera kuno ku liiso eddala.

40
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.360
